From: MiaAI-Lab <noreply@localhost>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:21:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] exl3: CB_MCG_E4M3, the mcg codebook rounded to E4M3
 (EXLR8's weight values), checked bit for bit against exlr8.cu

---
 zig/kernels/cuda/exl3_decode.cuh | 18 +++++-
 zig/tests/exl3_e4m3_check.cu     | 97 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 114 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
